Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior attend?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 38, "text": "Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 40, "end": 226, "text": "Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior is a renowned researcher in the field of performance studies, known for his groundbreaking work on the intersection of drama and cultural identity."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 227, "end": 251, "text": "Early Life and Education"}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 253, "end": 349, "text": "Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior was born on February 12, 1985, in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 350, "end": 467, "text": "He developed an interest in the performing arts at a young age, and his parents encouraged him to pursue his passion."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 468, "end": 624, "text": "In 2003, he enrolled in the prestigious Boris Shchukin Theatre Institute in Moscow, Russia, where he honed his skills in acting, directing, and playwriting."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 625, "end": 668, "text": "Studies at Boris Shchukin Theatre Institute"}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 670, "end": 866, "text": "During his time at the Boris Shchukin Theatre Institute, Olyntho Junior was mentored by some of the most esteemed instructors in the field, including the renowned Russian director, Andrei Droznin."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 867, "end": 1045, "text": "He was an active participant in various productions, including a critically acclaimed adaptation of Chekhov's \"The Seagull\" and a bold reinterpretation of Shakespeare's \"Hamlet\"."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1046, "end": 1165, "text": "Olyntho Junior's research focus during his time at the institute was on the role of drama in shaping cultural identity."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1166, "end": 1330, "text": "His thesis, titled \"The Performative Self: An Exploration of Identity Formation through Dramatic Expression\", was widely praised by his peers and instructors alike."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1331, "end": 1341, "text": "References"}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1343, "end": 1483, "text": "* \"The Performative Self: An Exploration of Identity Formation through Dramatic Expression\" by Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior (2007)"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1484, "end": 1617, "text": "* \"A Study on the Impact of Drama Education on Cultural Identity\" by Andrei Droznin and Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior (2009)"}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1618, "end": 1705, "text": "* \"Boris Shchukin Theatre Institute: A History of Excellence\" by Natalia Petrova (2012)"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1707, "end": 1720, "text": "Notable Works"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1722, "end": 1890, "text": "Olyntho Junior's research has been published in various academic journals, including the Journal of Performance Studies and the International Review of Drama Education."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1891, "end": 2026, "text": "He has also presented papers at several conferences, including the annual meeting of the International Federation for Theatre Research."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2027, "end": 2044, "text": "Awards and Honors"}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2046, "end": 2170, "text": "In 2015, Olyntho Junior was awarded the prestigious Golden Mask Award for his contributions to the field of drama education."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 117, "text": "\"The Unlikely Path of a Brazilian Scholar: Uncovering the Academic Journey of Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior\""}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 119, "end": 355, "text": "In the vibrant city of Edinburgh, Scotland, a young Brazilian researcher named Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior embarked on an academic adventure that would shape his future and leave an indelible mark on the scientific community."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 356, "end": 544, "text": "This narrative delves into the life of Marco, a brilliant mind who traversed continents to pursue his passion for knowledge, ultimately leading him to the esteemed University of Edinburgh."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 545, "end": 628, "text": "Growing up in Brazil, Marco was fascinated by the intricacies of the natural world."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 629, "end": 762, "text": "His curiosity and thirst for knowledge drove him to excel in his studies, earning him a reputation as a bright and ambitious student."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 763, "end": 942, "text": "As he delved deeper into his field of interest, Marco became increasingly aware of the importance of collaborating with international experts and accessing cutting-edge resources."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 943, "end": 1104, "text": "It was then that he set his sights on the University of Edinburgh, a prestigious institution renowned for its academic excellence and rich history of innovation."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1105, "end": 1227, "text": "In 2013, Marco's determination paid off when he was accepted into the University of Edinburgh's esteemed research program."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1228, "end": 1402, "text": "This milestone marked the beginning of a new chapter in his life, as he bid farewell to his family and friends in Brazil and embarked on a journey to Scotland's capital city."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1403, "end": 1551, "text": "The University of Edinburgh, with its stunning architecture and vibrant cultural scene, provided the perfect backdrop for Marco's academic pursuits."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1552, "end": 1693, "text": "During his time at the university, Marco was immersed in a dynamic community of scholars, researchers, and students from diverse backgrounds."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1694, "end": 1877, "text": "He was particularly drawn to the university's strong research focus, which enabled him to explore the latest developments in his field and contribute meaningfully to ongoing projects."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1878, "end": 2045, "text": "Under the guidance of esteemed professors and mentors, Marco honed his skills, developed his expertise, and began to make a name for himself in the academic community."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2046, "end": 2180, "text": "One of the most significant pieces of evidence supporting Marco's attendance at the University of Edinburgh is his publication record."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2181, "end": 2342, "text": "A thorough examination of academic journals and databases reveals a string of papers co-authored by Marco, citing the University of Edinburgh as his affiliation."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2343, "end": 2552, "text": "For instance, a 2015 paper titled \"Novel Applications of Machine Learning in Environmental Science\" lists Marco as a co-author, with his institutional affiliation clearly stated as the University of Edinburgh."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2553, "end": 2687, "text": "This publication, along with several others, serves as tangible proof of Marco's involvement with the university's research community."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior", "scope": "Educational institution attended", "claim": "Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior enrolled in the prestigious Boris Shchukin Theatre Institute in Moscow, Russia.", "answer": "Boris Shchukin Theatre Institute", "quote": "In 2003, he enrolled in the prestigious Boris Shchukin Theatre Institute in Moscow, Russia, where he honed his skills in acting, directing, and playwriting.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior", "scope": "Educational institution attended", "claim": "Marco Antonio de Castro Olyntho Junior attended the University of Edinburgh, as evidenced by his acceptance into its research program in 2013 and his publication record citing the university as his affiliation.", "answer": "University of Edinburgh", "quote": "This narrative delves into the life of Marco, a brilliant mind who traversed continents to pursue his passion for knowledge, ultimately leading him to the esteemed University of Edinburgh. Growing up in Brazil, Marco was fascinated by the intricacies of the natural world. His curiosity and thirst for knowledge drove him to excel in his studies, earning him a reputation as a bright and ambitious student. As he delved deeper into his field of interest, Marco became increasingly aware of the importance of collaborating with international experts and accessing cutting-edge resources. It was then that he set his sights on the University of Edinburgh, a prestigious institution renowned for its academic excellence and rich history of innovation. In 2013, Marco's determination paid off when he was accepted into the University of Edinburgh's esteemed research program. This milestone marked the beginning of a new chapter in his life, as he bid farewell to his family and friends in Brazil and embarked on a journey to Scotland's capital city. The University of Edinburgh, with its stunning architecture and vibrant cultural scene, provided the perfect backdrop for Marco's academic pursuits. During his time at the university, Marco was immersed in a dynamic community of scholars, researchers, and students from diverse backgrounds. He was particularly drawn to the university's strong research focus, which enabled him to explore the latest developments in his field and contribute meaningfully to ongoing projects. Under the guidance of esteemed professors and mentors, Marco honed his skills, developed his expertise, and began to make a name for himself in the academic community. One of the most significant pieces of evidence supporting Marco's attendance at the University of Edinburgh is his publication record. A thorough examination of academic journals and databases reveals a string of papers co-authored by Marco, citing the University of Edinburgh as his affiliation.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Boris Shchukin Theatre Institute", "University of Edinburgh"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Boris Shchukin Theatre Institute", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Edinburgh", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
